# cooling-box.speak — the math tier as a sentence.
# SET lowers field arithmetic through the broadcast machinery: the
# interpreter walks the lazy tree, the compiler emits fuse2 codegen —
# one fused loop, zero temporaries, same numbers either way.

-- CONFIG --
GRID IS 33 BY 33
WORLD IS 2.0 WIDE
TIME FROM 0 TO 10 BY 0.1
SEED IS 3

-- DATA --
temperature IS FIELD
alpha IS NUMBER WITH VALUE 0.05
cool IS NUMBER WITH VALUE 0.002
stove IS SPOT AT 1.0, 1.0

-- SETUP --
SOLVE dtemperature/dt = alpha * lap(temperature)
APPLY BOUNDARY wall TO temperature
HOLD temperature AT 5.0 WITHIN 0.2 OF stove

-- SIMULATION --
STEP THE FIELD
SET temperature TO (temperature - cool) * 0.999
REPORT MEAN temperature AND MAX OF temperature EVERY 20
